---
title: Create an account
description: Register on the campus with a username and password, and learn which details end up on your certificates.
sidebar:
  order: 5
---

If you prefer not to link Nostr, GitHub or Google, create a classic account with your email.

## Steps

{% steps %}

1. Open [campus.ismos.xyz/login/signup.php](https://campus.ismos.xyz/login/signup.php) or click **Create new account** on the sign-in page.

2. Fill in the form. Marked fields are required.

3. Click **Create my new account**. You will receive a confirmation email.

4. Open the email and click the link to activate the account. You cannot sign in until you do.

{% /steps %}

## The form fields

| Field | Notes |
| --- | --- |
| **Username** | Lowercase only, no spaces. You use it to sign in; it is not shown to others. |
| **Password** | At least 8 characters, with at least one uppercase letter, one lowercase letter, one digit and one symbol (`*`, `-`, `#`…). |
| **Email** | The activation email and course notices go there. Type it twice to avoid typos. |
| **First and last name** | You may use a **pseudonym**. Whatever you type here is exactly what will appear on your certificates. |
| **City and country** | Optional. |

{% aside type="note" title="About certificates" %}
Certificates are generated with the first and last name from your profile, exactly as written. If you need your legal name on them, write it that way. If you prefer a pseudonym, that works too. You can change it later in [your profile](/en/cuenta/perfil-e-idioma/), but certificates already issued are not regenerated automatically.
{% /aside %}

## The confirmation email never arrives

- Check your **spam** or promotions folder.
- Make sure you typed the email correctly. If you got it wrong, register again with a different username.
- If more than 15 minutes pass, contact us with your username and we will activate the account by hand.
